Description: Local web server manager - Sites Dashboard
 Nginx + PHP-FPM + MariaDB manager with interactive TUI dashboard.
 Manage sites: start/stop services, create sites, backup/restore,
 SSL, WordPress updates, export. Includes newsite helper.
